(text "R125/R126 gives local start~7.25V / stop~6.76V; upstream UV disconnect acts first in steady state.\n2.2nF bootstrap value is intentional. CA is between RIPPLE and VOUT; CB couples to FB.\nKelvin FB bottom return to pin1/EP. Minimize VIN–SW–GND hot loop and switch-node copper.\nL121 manufacturer recommended land pattern is derived in POWER_FOOTPRINT_REVIEW.md." (at 17.78 263.525 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2af433bd-353b-5335-8b7d-e1747e1b0d02"))
